{"ID":"20240205153718-plwblvp","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153718-plwblvp","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153718-plwblvp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205171546-6w07fz9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613093725-i4eqnse\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613094217-dpdhs8w\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:2,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:2\u0026#125;","title":"286白及（白芨）","type":"doc","updated":"20240823112404"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205171546-6w07fz9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205171546-6w07fz9","updated":"20240205171606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【來源】\t蘭科植物白及Bletilla striata (Thunb.) Reichb. f.的乾燥塊莖。\n【產地】\t主產雲貴地區以及湖北、江西等地。\n【性狀】\t該品呈不規則扁圓形，多有23 個爪狀分枝，長1.55cm，厚0.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.5cm。表面灰白色或黃白色，有數圈同心環節和棕色點狀鬚根痕，上面有凸起的莖痕，下面有連接另一塊莖的痕跡。質堅硬，不易折斷，斷面類白色，角質樣。無臭，味苦，嚼之有黏性。\n【性味】\t味苦、甘、澀，微寒。\n【功效】\t補肺，止血，消腫，生肌，斂瘡。治肺傷咳血，衄血，金瘡出血，癰疽腫毒，潰瘍疼痛，湯火灼傷，手足皸裂。\n【注解】\t“環紋”指白及藥材表面的數圈同心環節。"}]},{"ID":"20240205162526-exfsxik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162526-exfsxik","updated":"20240221114723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240205171529-3gtfqwt.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240205171528-6bo6j0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205171528-6bo6j0u"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芨"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芨-20240205162526-nc24ony.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205162526-ipg581g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162526-ipg581g","updated":"20240205162526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芨2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芨2-20240205162526-m8asje1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240629085954-xswf1ss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240629085954-xswf1ss","updated":"20240823110638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 397px;","style":"width: 387px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芨1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芨1-20240629085954-13yj7t9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 387px;\" parent-style=\"width: 397px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 396px;","style":"width: 386px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芨3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芨3-20240629090038-bf2n5ut.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 386px;\" parent-style=\"width: 396px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 376px;","style":"width: 366px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芨7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"}